-- ==============================================================================
-- Tytul:        setup_target.oby
-- Opis:         Polecenia adminclient dla deploymentu oggtarget (blok 9 raportu), po CONNECT i aliasie
--               ggtarget z potoku 88_oggconf_target.sh: heartbeat, tabela checkpoint, Parallel
--               Replicat (bez opcji powstalby classic Replicat), profil MAA, start.
-- Description [EN]: adminclient commands for deployment oggtarget (report block 9), after CONNECT and
--               the ggtarget alias from the 88_oggconf_target.sh pipe: heartbeat, checkpoint table,
--               Parallel Replicat (without the option a classic Replicat), MAA profile, start.
-- Autor: KCB Kris | Data: 2026-11-15 | Wersja: 1.1 | Konwencje: <repo>/SETTINGS.md
-- ==============================================================================
DBLOGIN USERIDALIAS ggtarget DOMAIN OracleGoldenGate
-- LAB: syntax not checked in the 26ai Reference. FREQUENCY 5: the default 60 s makes the lag curve a staircase (film L1)
ADD HEARTBEATTABLE, FREQUENCY 5
ADD CHECKPOINTTABLE ggadmin.ggs_checkpoint
ADD REPLICAT rep1, PARALLEL, EXTTRAIL et, CHECKPOINTTABLE ggadmin.ggs_checkpoint
-- MAA Task 11 managed process profile (LAB: adminclient syntax; else Web UI, see README)
ADD PROFILE MAA AUTOSTART YES DELAY 60 AUTORESTART YES RETRIES 5 WAITSECONDS 30 RESETSECONDS 1800 DISABLEONFAILURE YES
ALTER REPLICAT rep1, PROFILE MAA
START REPLICAT rep1
INFO REPLICAT rep1
